Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.00,0:01:03.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在对你们来说还不算太晚\N{\rEng}It's not too late for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.77,0:01:06.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的提议依然有效\N{\rEng}My offer still stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.26,0:01:09.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要么加入我们\N{\rEng}You can join us...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.62,0:01:11.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要么去死\N{\rEng}or you can die.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.69,0:01:31.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,转身\N{\rEng}Turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.49,0:02:09.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\rEng}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.30,0:02:10.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么拍照\N{\rEng}Why the pictures?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.16,0:02:13.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之后给你做雕塑\N{\rEng}Sculpt you, after.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.42,0:02:16.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么之后\N{\rEng}After what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.38,0:02:18.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是之后\N{\rEng}After.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.67,0:02:58.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.21,0:03:36.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fs18\b1\bord1\shad1\3c&H2F2F2F&}我知道的事\N我知道我不知道的事\N我不知道的事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.83,0:03:59.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你是叛徒\N{\rEng}I'm well-aware ‭you're the fifth columner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.11,0:04:03.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绿包  红漆  工人的枪\N{\rEng}Green duffel, red paint, workers' guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.27,0:04:07.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不需要图灵级别的解密\N{\rEng}Doesn't require Turing-grade decryption
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.98,0:04:09.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就能得知这一真相\N{\rEng}to grok the truth that you're the traitor
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.23,0:04:11.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是跟"亚山神"勾结的叛徒\N{\rEng}creeping and colluding with AHK.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.38,0:04:13.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我创的首字母缩写词\N{\rEng}It's an acronym I've concocted --
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.88,0:04:15.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚历山大  山顶寨  神之国\N{\rEng}Alexandria, Hilltop, Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.34,0:04:16.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本来想用"神亚山"\N{\rEng}I considered going with KAH,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.67,0:04:18.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这个词太像象声词了\N{\rEng}but it remains ‭a hair too onomatopoeiac.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.02,0:04:22.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼根本人亲自安排我\N{\rEng}I've been charged ‭by no less than Negan himself
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.01,0:04:23.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到解决灾难的办法\N{\rEng}with cracking the very calamity
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.87,0:04:26.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你大有可能是主要诱因\N{\rEng}you more than likely had a heavy hand in creating.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.77,0:04:32.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我需要你立刻停止并终止\N{\rEng}So I need you to cease and desist
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.71,0:04:34.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切背叛和背后捅刀\N{\rEng}all betrayals and backstabbery,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.08,0:04:37.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打幌子和叛变行为\N{\rEng}fronting and Judas-ness A.S.A.P.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.02,0:04:42.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为交换  我不会把我知道的信息\N{\rEng}In exchange, ‭I offer to keep what I know
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.29,0:04:44.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉尼根和其他人\N{\rEng}from Negan and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.76,0:05:06.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救世军完了\N{\rEng}The Saviors are finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.28,0:05:10.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼根完了\N{\rEng}Negan's finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.66,0:05:13.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这地方\N{\rEng}And this place...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.45,0:05:15.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过去的辉煌\N{\rEng}what it's been...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.96,0:05:18.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全完了\N{\rEng}that's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.89,0:05:23.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,食物和水短缺  工人很愤怒\N{\rEng}Food and water's runnin' low, workers are angry,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.61,0:05:25.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救世军心慌意乱\N{\rEng}the Saviors, they're gettin' scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.97,0:05:28.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这地方必将陷落\N{\rEng}And this place is gonna fall,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.28,0:05:32.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要想站在获胜的一方  唯一要做的\N{\rEng}and all you have to do to be on the winning side
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.06,0:05:33.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是顺势而为\N{\rEng}is to stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.27,0:05:36.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都不要做\N{\rEng}All you have to do is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.24,0:05:38.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等着\N{\rEng}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.19,0:05:40.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静观其变\N{\rEng}Let it play out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.46,0:05:42.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能做到吗\N{\rEng}Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.11,0:05:50.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你见过这里发生的事\N{\rEng}You've seen what happens here...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.46,0:05:55.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听到过尖叫\N{\rEng}heard the screams...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.22,0:05:59.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闻到过烧伤的皮肤\N{\rEng}smelled the burning skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.71,0:06:04.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在还没杀人\N{\rEng}You don't got blood on your hands yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.64,0:06:06.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但那很快了\N{\rEng}but that's comin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.95,0:06:11.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一旦你做了那些事  你就成了坏人\N{\rEng}Once you do those things, you become those things,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.44,0:06:13.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再也无法回头了\N{\rEng}and there's no goin' back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.56,0:06:15.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再也无法忘记\N{\rEng}No forgettin' it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.53,0:06:20.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的目的就是保命\N{\rEng}What cranks my shaft is bein' safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.95,0:06:25.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而在这里  我安全\N{\rEng}And here, me bein' safe
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.45,0:06:27.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意味着很多人也安全\N{\rEng}means a whole lot of other people are safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.17,0:06:29.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我常想到这点\N{\rEng}I think about that a great deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.40,0:06:44.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  我是尼根\N{\rEng}Yes, I'm Negan...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.09,0:06:50.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这并不完美  但我们是救世军\N{\rEng}and it ain't perfect, but we are Saviors.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.92,0:06:53.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要救人\N{\rEng}We save.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.76,0:07:03.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如我所说\N{\rEng}Like I said...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.98,0:07:07.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的叛变活动未被察觉\N{\rEng}your Cloak-and-Dagger's on the Q.T.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.81,0:07:14.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要你不做任何伤害墙内人的事\N{\rEng}All I ask is that you do nothin' that results in harm to anyone inside these walls,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.56,0:07:16.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就不会揭发你\N{\rEng}and it'll stay that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.27,0:07:52.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得能撑多久\N{\rEng}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.94,0:07:55.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一天吧\N{\rEng}A day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.77,0:07:57.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许两天\N{\rEng}Maybe two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.97,0:08:13.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尤金\N{\rEng}Eugene.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.21,0:08:15.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要帮忙\N{\rEng}I could use a little help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.99,0:08:16.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进来一下好吗\N{\rEng}Can you come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.71,0:08:21.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他情况更糟了\N{\rEng}He's getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.05,0:08:27.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是一种感染\N{\rEng}It's an infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.62,0:08:28.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也可能是多种\N{\rEng}Maybe more than one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.97,0:08:32.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在攻击他的脏器\N{\rEng}It's attacking his organs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.11,0:08:34.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,某个脏器衰竭只是时间问题\N{\rEng}It's only a matter of time until one fails.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.14,0:08:36.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真希望我们能有些该死的药\N{\rEng}Just wish ‭we had some damn meds.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.28,0:08:37.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真希望他没有\N{\rEng}I wish he hadn't
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.36,0:08:40.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,参与设计这么拙劣的陷阱把我们困在这\N{\rEng}assisted in the ill-conceived caper to trap us in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.48,0:08:43.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还希望有彩色糖果吃\N{\rEng}I also wish for Razzles,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.01,0:08:44.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果愿望都能实现  那可就...\N{\rEng}but if wishes ‭were horses and all that...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.03,0:08:47.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么  你觉得这都是他的错吗\N{\rEng}What, you think this is his fault?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.53,0:08:48.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\rEng}It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.90,0:08:49.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是全部\N{\rEng}Not the whole of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.63,0:08:51.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他是叛军的一员\N{\rEng}but he was ‭a member of the campaign.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.17,0:08:54.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能理解他\N{\rEng}I do get it...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.91,0:08:56.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我不会忘记的\N{\rEng}but I shan't forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.99,0:08:59.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你陪陪他好吗\N{\rEng}Would you sit with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.28,0:09:00.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你干什么\N{\rEng}How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.57,0:09:01.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去市场看看\N{\rEng}I'm gonna head to the marketplace,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.82,0:09:03.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看能否找到草药\N{\rEng}see if they have any herbs down there,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.77,0:09:05.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给他试试草药\N{\rEng}try some Eastern medicine on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.66,0:09:07.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不能没人看护\N{\rEng}He shouldn't be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.23,0:09:10.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-而且他是你的朋友  -旅伴而已\N{\rEng}- And he's your friend. - Traveling Companion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.38,0:09:12.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  你希望他死吗\N{\rEng}Okay. Do you want him to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.65,0:09:14.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.14,0:09:17.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很快就回来\N{\rEng}I'll be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.64,0:09:41.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐吧\N{\rEng}Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.95,0:09:44.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你脸色比我还差\N{\rEng}You look worse than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.58,0:09:48.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不这么想\N{\rEng}I don't appreciate that,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.78,0:09:51.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你看起来好像土豆烩大便\N{\rEng}because you look like a potato and shit casserole.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.08,0:09:55.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐\N{\rEng}Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.63,0:10:42.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能帮我把卡森医生救出去吗\N{\rEng}Are you gonna help me get Dr. Carson out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.75,0:10:47.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鉴于这栋建筑目前被行尸团团围住\N{\rEng}Given that this building is currently surrounded by a Wilkes-Barre of walkers,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.31,0:10:50.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认为无法逃离\N{\rEng}I don't see an escape attempt
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.56,0:10:53.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非使用陷你于这种糟糕境地的\N{\rEng}without putting to use the same flawed technique of innards
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.12,0:10:55.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那种漏洞百出的内脏涂身方法\N{\rEng}which landed you in your status-quo piss-poor condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.48,0:10:59.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你提出这种要求时可能忘了\N{\rEng}What you may have forgotten in your request
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.05,0:11:00.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是个小人物\N{\rEng}is that I am a small person
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.67,0:11:03.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会为任何人冒险  除了我自己\N{\rEng}who does not stick his neck out for anyone other than himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.47,0:11:05.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只在自己的车道上行驶\N{\rEng}I stick firmly within my lane
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.90,0:11:08.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不需要信号灯  不管是手动还是自动\N{\rEng}without any need for a signal, hand or automatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.22,0:11:13.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只希望你能做正确的事\N{\rEng}All I want is for you to do the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.04,0:11:16.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正确的事该怎么定义\N{\rEng}And what is said definition on that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.69,0:11:18.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从来没有搞清楚过\N{\rEng}Can't say I ever sussed it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.48,0:11:21.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对有些人正确的事  对另一些人可能是噩梦\N{\rEng}Right for some can be downright horrific for others,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.68,0:11:22.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就因为熟知这点\N{\rEng}and knowing that has kept me vertical
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.97,0:11:24.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我还站着  而别人倒下了\N{\rEng}when so many have gone horizontal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.54,0:11:30.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这需要信念  自我信任\N{\rEng}It requires faith, trusting yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.83,0:11:36.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信上帝就在你心中\N{\rEng}Believing that God is inside of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.59,0:11:38.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,指导你\N{\rEng}guiding you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.07,0:11:43.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道他对我们的命运各有安排\N{\rEng}and knowing that he has a plan for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.62,0:11:45.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那很难吗\N{\rEng}Is that so hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.36,0:11:47.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那很荒谬\N{\rEng}It's absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.71,0:11:49.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\rEng}Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.73,0:11:52.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你相信科学\N{\rEng}You're a man of science...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.51,0:11:58.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不久之前还不相信\N{\rEng}who not too long ago would've found it
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.52,0:12:02.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死人可以重新行走于世上\N{\rEng}impossible to believe that the dead could walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.01,0:12:07.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以也许\N{\rEng}So maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.70,0:12:10.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也有可能相信\N{\rEng}maybe it's not impossible to believe
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.92,0:12:15.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当那一刻来临时  你会知道\N{\rEng}that you will know what the right thing is
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.19,0:12:16.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么做才是正确的\N{\rEng}when the time comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.88,0:12:18.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后\N{\rEng}And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.68,0:12:25.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会...做的\N{\rEng}you will -- you'll act.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.04,0:12:54.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有发现\N{\rEng}Got something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.33,0:12:56.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是一辆卡车\N{\rEng}Looked like a truck,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.11,0:12:58.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是开过了水塔看不到了\N{\rEng}but I lost visual from the water tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.75,0:13:19.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我们的人\N{\rEng}It's one of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.45,0:13:27.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塔尼娅  你好\N{\rEng}Tanya, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.69,0:13:29.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说一周  已经一周了\N{\rEng}You said a week. It's been a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.80,0:13:35.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的约定呢  我的音响呢\N{\rEng}Our deal? My boombox?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.31,0:13:37.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  我是说...\N{\rEng}Well, yes, I mean --
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.33,0:13:38.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你修好了吗\N{\rEng}Did you fix it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.01,0:13:42.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是认真的吗\N{\rEng}A-are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.66,0:13:43.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.97,0:13:45.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没修好\N{\rEng}Well, it's not ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.29,0:13:47.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们被行尸掐着喉咙\N{\rEng}Our neck is ‭in the noose of the deceased,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.16,0:13:48.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,情况越来越恶劣\N{\rEng}and it is tightening with every ticktock.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.73,0:13:51.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一点都不担心我们被困在这里吗\N{\rEng}Are you not distressed that we're trapped?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.72,0:13:54.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以前就被困在这里\N{\rEng}I was already trapped here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.64,0:13:56.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天之前给我  尤金\N{\rEng}You've got until tomorrow, Eugene,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.90,0:13:58.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后再议\N{\rEng}and then we renegotiate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.89,0:14:00.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等\N{\rEng}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.19,0:14:05.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然没有修好  但是能不能把\N{\rEng}Would it be possible to take possession of the second bottle
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.89,0:14:07.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二瓶先预付给我\N{\rEng}despe the delivery delinquency?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.31,0:14:11.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们说好的是先给你一瓶\N{\rEng}The deal was one bottle up front
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.57,0:14:14.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,修好后再给你一瓶\N{\rEng}and one bottle after you fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.73,0:14:15.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很需要\N{\rEng}I need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.11,0:14:21.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要用来当燃料之类的吗\N{\rEng}You making it into jet fuel or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.49,0:14:26.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚上我都要喝个1.5盎司左右\N{\rEng}I've taken to throwing 1.5 fluid ounces down my gullet most P.M.S
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.22,0:14:29.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才能够进入越来越不安稳的睡眠\N{\rEng}as a necessary requirement to catching ‭some increasingly elusive Z's.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.08,0:14:34.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我需要这些傻笑饮料\N{\rEng}Ergo, I need the giggle juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.14,0:14:49.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\rEng}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.40,0:14:52.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也需要助眠\N{\rEng}I need help sleeping, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.48,0:14:53.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\rEng}I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.23,0:14:55.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你明白\N{\rEng}Yes, you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.37,0:14:57.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你帮助他们  尤金\N{\rEng}You help them, Eugene.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.98,0:14:59.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你帮助他\N{\rEng}You help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.17,0:15:02.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我试图阻止过\N{\rEng}I tried to stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.56,0:15:06.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和弗兰基来找你\N{\rEng}Me and Frankie, we came to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.17,0:15:08.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,寻求帮助\N{\rEng}and we asked you for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.97,0:15:12.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你本可以让这个地方变得不一样\N{\rEng}You could've changed this place into something else,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.40,0:15:13.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变得更好\N{\rEng}something better.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.40,0:15:15.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你只为自己着想\N{\rEng}But you took care of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.78,0:15:18.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你得承受后果\N{\rEng}and now you've got to live with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.34,0:15:22.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望这能帮你\N{\rEng}I hope this helps.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.97,0:15:25.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但其实帮不了\N{\rEng}But it won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.23,0:15:30.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼根要见你\N{\rEng}Negan wants you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.26,0:15:38.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的人很快就到救世堂\N{\rEng}Our people are gonna be at the Sanctuary soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.21,0:15:39.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要求他们投降\N{\rEng}asking for their surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.61,0:15:41.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们快成功了\N{\rEng}We're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.46,0:15:44.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们才要这么做\N{\rEng}That's why we do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.12,0:15:46.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要确保成功\N{\rEng}We make it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.63,0:15:49.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们与上方窗户的人交火来掩护你\N{\rEng}So we cover you with crossfire from the upper windows,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.02,0:15:52.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你开车穿过尸群\N{\rEng}you crash the truck into the walkers
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.26,0:15:53.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撞向大楼\N{\rEng}and through to the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.34,0:15:56.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  撞个豁口  救世军自助餐\N{\rEng}Yep, crack it open, Savior buffet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.35,0:15:59.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确定工人会逃掉  到楼上去吗\N{\rEng}You know the workers will make it away, up the stairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.71,0:16:02.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在大楼的另一边  应该能逃掉\N{\rEng}They're on the other side of the building. They should make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.09,0:16:02.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\rEng}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.63,0:16:04.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们这样做之后\N{\rEng}After we do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.52,0:16:06.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们别无选择  只能投降\N{\rEng}their only choice is to give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.08,0:16:08.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这有风险  他们也许能看到卡车来\N{\rEng}It's risky. They could see the truck comin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.04,0:16:10.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救世军的仓库里\N{\rEng}There weren't any more weapons
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.07,0:16:11.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经没有武器了  不是吗\N{\rEng}at the Saviors' warehouse, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.87,0:16:13.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,火箭筒没火箭弹了\N{\rEng}No more rockets for the RPGs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.15,0:16:15.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们只能利用现有的东西\N{\rEng}We work with what we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.46,0:16:16.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们还有我\N{\rEng}You got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.26,0:16:20.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以及其他狙击手\N{\rEng}Other snipers, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.81,0:16:23.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果救世军看到你们来  我们负责掩护\N{\rEng}Saviors see you comin', we got you covered,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.78,0:16:25.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不惜一切代价\N{\rEng}whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.03,0:16:27.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想了结这事\N{\rEng}I want it done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.29,0:16:29.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想了结他们\N{\rEng}I want them done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.73,0:16:31.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好\N{\rEng}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.98,0:16:33.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们到底行不行动\N{\rEng}So, we doin' this or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.60,0:16:35.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们为什么不按原计划  耐心等待呢\N{\rEng}W-Why don't we just wait it out like we planned?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.14,0:16:38.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米琼恩说得对\N{\rEng}Michonne's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.74,0:16:41.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的提议太冒险了  可能会出岔子\N{\rEng}What you're talking about is risky. Things could go bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.31,0:16:43.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带音箱的那辆卡车差点引走了尸群\N{\rEng}The truck with the speakers almost took all those walkers away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.87,0:16:46.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差点出了岔子  还可能发生其他意外\N{\rEng}It almost did go bad. Something else could.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.92,0:16:47.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算不出意外\N{\rEng}Even if it don't,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.65,0:16:49.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也失去神之国的战士了\N{\rEng}we don't got ‭the Kingdom fighters no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.04,0:16:51.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果救世军决心抵抗\N{\rEng}I mean, if the Saviors want to put up a fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.49,0:16:53.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也没有足够的人手迫使他们投降\N{\rEng}we don't got the numbers to make 'em surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.81,0:16:55.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以瑞克去找拾荒者谈判了\N{\rEng}That's why Rick's talking to the Scavengers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.48,0:16:57.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你中了枪  他们骗了我们\N{\rEng}You got shot. They lied to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.78,0:16:58.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你倒相信他们了\N{\rEng}You -- You believe 'em now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.86,0:17:00.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信瑞克·格兰姆斯\N{\rEng}I believe in Rick Grimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.39,0:17:02.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本可以做点什么的\N{\rEng}I could've done something...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.29,0:17:04.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更快了结此事\N{\rEng}sooner, to end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.80,0:17:08.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道海边旅馆有武器  而我却在等\N{\rEng}I knew about those weapons at Oceanside, and I waited.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.11,0:17:11.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我什么都没做\N{\rEng}I didn't do shit about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.30,0:17:13.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管你参不参与\N{\rEng}With or without you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.76,0:17:15.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都不会让那重演\N{\rEng}I'm not ‭letting that happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.26,0:17:17.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就不参与\N{\rEng}Then it's without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.80,0:17:22.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我退出\N{\rEng}I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.55,0:17:28.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还有些车停在东边哨点附近\N{\rEng}We got somcars parked near the east-side lookout.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.34,0:17:30.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以开一辆回家\N{\rEng}You can take one and go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.07,0:17:36.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要留下吗\N{\rEng}You staying?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.07,0:17:39.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也同意这样做吗\N{\rEng}You good with all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.57,0:17:40.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我起的头\N{\rEng}I helped get this started.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.39,0:17:43.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得确保成功\N{\rEng}Got to see it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.22,0:17:47.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得在这冒险\N{\rEng}You think it's easier to come out here and risk
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.40,0:17:49.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比回去等机会更容易\N{\rEng}than to stay back there and wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.32,0:17:53.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白  我以前也这么想\N{\rEng}And I get it -- ‭I used to believe that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.64,0:17:56.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但事实是  有时你必须等待\N{\rEng}Thing is sometimes, you just have to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.38,0:17:59.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时你没办法知道\N{\rEng}Sometimes you don't get to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.02,0:18:00.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只希望自己不是在\N{\rEng}I just wish it didn't take
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.90,0:18:03.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看着萨沙从棺材里出来后  才明白这一点\N{\rEng}seeing Sasha walk out of that coffin to realize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.44,0:18:09.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\rEng}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.91,0:18:10.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\rEng}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.69,0:18:38.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不尽快解决\N{\rEng}If things don't get fixed soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.86,0:18:40.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会死很多人\N{\rEng}a lot of people are gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.71,0:18:42.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的人\N{\rEng}My people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.89,0:18:45.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了  我不会死\N{\rEng}Not me, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.60,0:18:47.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管发生什么  我都能活下来\N{\rEng}I'm livin' no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.84,0:18:49.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我太擅长做这种事了\N{\rEng}I am too good at this shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.57,0:18:50.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是其他人\N{\rEng}But others...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.80,0:18:53.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能眼看着他们死\N{\rEng}I can't have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.81,0:18:56.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想看着我的人被打死  被撕碎\N{\rEng}I don't want to see people get shot up, chewed up,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.71,0:18:57.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再去咬其他人\N{\rEng}and chewing up the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.96,0:19:01.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想看着你被咬死  尤金\N{\rEng}I don't want to see you get eaten, Eugene.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.72,0:19:06.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个地方\N{\rEng}This place,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.23,0:19:12.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,建立于集中和组织力量的基础之上\N{\rEng}it's about pooling and organizing strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.68,0:19:15.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你\N{\rEng}And you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.07,0:19:20.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的朋友  非常强大\N{\rEng}my friend, are strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.30,0:19:25.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的眼睛和长发间的那个海绵体器官\N{\rEng}That spongy organ between your eyes and your spectacular mullet
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.85,0:19:28.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常强大\N{\rEng}is strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.47,0:19:31.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只想让你知道\N{\rEng}and I just want to make sure that you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.27,0:19:33.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道这一点\N{\rEng}that I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.10,0:19:36.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当做我知道吧\N{\rEng}Consider me made.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.78,0:19:40.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的想法完全一致\N{\rEng}Our pages are utterly and completely one and the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.02,0:20:00.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尤金\N{\rEng}Eugene...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.24,0:20:03.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是想要握手的\N{\rEng}I was going for a handshake.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.43,0:20:09.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站起来\N{\rEng}Stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.83,0:20:16.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你在困惑什么\N{\rEng}Now, I can see where you'd be confused,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.60,0:20:19.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我很少做这种破事\N{\rEng}as I rarely do that shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.00,0:20:22.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,握手代表着相互尊重\N{\rEng}A handshake is a sign of mutual respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.16,0:20:26.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能得到我尊重的人并不是很多\N{\rEng}Not many people get that from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.00,0:20:34.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些工作需要去做了\N{\rEng}There's work that needs getting to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.92,0:22:42.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关掉引擎\N{\rEng}Hey, cut that engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.11,0:22:45.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再靠近的话会引来院子里的行尸\N{\rEng}Any closer, you'll draw walkers from the yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.90,0:23:00.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给\N{\rEng}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.59,0:23:07.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们吸引火力  我们反击\N{\rEng}You take fire from the windows, we fire back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.82,0:23:12.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\rEng}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.90,0:23:15.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斜道旁有个掩护点\N{\rEng}There's a spot for cover by the chutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.59,0:23:25.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你准备好了吗\N{\rEng}You up for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.28,0:23:32.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来这是想亲眼见证一下\N{\rEng}I came here 'cause I wanted to see things for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.25,0:23:36.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想知道计划管用\N{\rEng}I wanted to know ‭that things were gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.53,0:23:39.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你知道吗\N{\rEng}But you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.08,0:23:43.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能确认这一点\N{\rEng}I don't get to know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.07,0:23:45.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都不能\N{\rEng}None of us do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.20,0:23:49.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道的是计划目前奏效了\N{\rEng}What I do know is that things are working now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.66,0:23:52.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以也许\N{\rEng}So maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.70,0:23:55.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们只能坚信\N{\rEng}we just need to trust
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.80,0:23:57.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,计划会一直奏效\N{\rEng}that things are gonna keep working,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.29,0:23:59.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为这件事\N{\rEng}because this...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.56,0:24:02.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们即将要做的事\N{\rEng}what we're about to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.25,0:24:06.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不值得我们冒生命危险\N{\rEng}it's not worth risking us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.35,0:24:10.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对我来说值得\N{\rEng}It is for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.81,0:24:14.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的值得\N{\rEng}Just is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.10,0:24:23.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望能成功\N{\rEng}I hope it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.30,0:24:28.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的希望能成功  但我做不到\N{\rEng}I-I really, really do, but I-I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.31,0:24:31.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的做不到\N{\rEng}I just can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.02,0:24:41.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你就不该去做\N{\rEng}Then you shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.38,0:25:17.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有摩根和狙击手\N{\rEng}We got Morgan and the snipers.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.45,0:25:18.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能做到\N{\rEng}We can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.98,0:25:21.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.45,0:25:23.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能做到\N{\rEng}We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.53,0:25:41.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,供日后记录用的录音\N{\rEng}Audio recording for transcription.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.44,0:25:43.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紧急行动手册  第一次分录\N{\rEng}Emergency operations manual, first entry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.97,0:25:47.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,栅栏被围攻时的解决方案\N{\rEng}Countermeasure approach for fence incursion.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.33,0:25:51.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行尸爆发  距之前的栅栏40到50英尺\N{\rEng}High pop of undead, good 40, 50 deep to the former fence.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.52,0:25:57.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得以后附上紧急粘合音频滑翔机草图\N{\rEng}Note to accompany schematics for audio glider emergency binder.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.01,0:26:00.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,音频滑翔机已开启声音\N{\rEng}Audio glider activated for sound,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.83,0:26:03.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使用95分贝音乐转移尸群注意力\N{\rEng}utilizing music as 96 decibel redirection,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.69,0:26:07.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吸引所有活跃行尸远离全部出口\N{\rEng}drawing active deceased along with it away from all exits,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.82,0:26:11.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,立即创造出逃生通道  以便永久引走尸群\N{\rEng}allowing immediate free passage for permanent redirection,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.71,0:26:13.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果成功的话\N{\rEng}if successful.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.98,0:26:18.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,划掉前面的"如果"  改为"成功之后"\N{\rEng}Scratch the if -- when -- when successful.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.31,0:26:19.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\rEng}Hell, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.00,0:26:25.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别转身\N{\rEng}Don't turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.20,0:26:47.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我到了\N{\rEng}I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.81,0:26:48.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我准备好了\N{\rEng}I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.06,0:26:53.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南边哨点  一切就绪\N{\rEng}South lookout -- ready for go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.39,0:26:56.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,东边哨点  就绪\N{\rEng}East lookout, ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.36,0:27:00.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,北边哨点  就绪\N{\rEng}North lookout, ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.21,0:27:03.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西边哨点  就绪\N{\rEng}West lookout, ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.08,0:27:13.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站起来  远离那东西\N{\rEng}Get up, back away from that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.61,0:27:19.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫你离远点\N{\rEng}Back away from it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.97,0:27:32.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是想救人  德怀特\N{\rEng}I'm attempting to save people, Dwight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.28,0:27:36.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀了我  就是杀了一群无辜的人\N{\rEng}And killin' me is killin' a great many innocents.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.80,0:27:41.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等这只小鸟出巢\N{\rEng}When this bird slips its surly bounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.42,0:27:44.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它就能引走那些冰冷的行尸\N{\rEng}it's gonna Pied Piper away their cold corpses
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.30,0:27:45.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,解放这里\N{\rEng}and free this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.71,0:27:49.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而尼根会杀了瑞克  达里尔和罗西塔\N{\rEng}And Negan will kill Rick and Daryl and Rosita
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.60,0:27:51.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有你的那些老朋友们\N{\rEng}and all your old friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.04,0:27:54.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们只是曾经的旅伴  仅此而已\N{\rEng}They're former traveling companions, nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.63,0:27:58.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和他们合作\N{\rEng}I'm working with them
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.43,0:28:01.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是为了让他们和这里的人活着\N{\rEng}to keep them ‭and the people here alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.36,0:28:04.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以杀掉尼根\N{\rEng}We can get rid of Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.75,0:28:06.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只杀尼根\N{\rEng}Just Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.43,0:28:09.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们马上就要成功了\N{\rEng}And we're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.40,0:28:13.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼根轻易死不了  德怀特\N{\rEng}Negan ain't the dyin' type, Dwight.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.14,0:28:15.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-但你死定了  尤金  -是的\N{\rEng}- Oh, but you are, Eugene. - I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.93,0:28:19.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正因此我才没有退开\N{\rEng}That's exactly why I've not yet stepped back, as it were.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.41,0:28:25.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我看来  我可以选择两种命运\N{\rEng}By my reckoning, I have two selects on facin' my fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.43,0:28:28.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一种是中止放飞滑翔机\N{\rEng}One, I abort launch on this glider,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.74,0:28:31.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让这里继续困在行尸的獠牙利齿之下\N{\rEng}don't free this place from the stranglehold of cold teeth/tongues,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.89,0:28:33.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而尼根很有可能会处死我\N{\rEng}and Negan will likely execute me
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.48,0:28:35.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还认为他是帮了我的忙\N{\rEng}as what he considers to be a personal favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.49,0:28:38.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者  我可以选第二种命运\N{\rEng}Or I could go for ‭what's behind door number two,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.67,0:28:41.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赌一把你这旧时盟友不会在我身后开枪\N{\rEng}take my chances being shot in the back by a sometime-ally,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.36,0:28:43.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽管以前我曾伤害过你\N{\rEng}despite any injury I may have caused in the past
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.26,0:28:46.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冲你裆部狠狠咬了一口\N{\rEng}by delivering a chomp down on your chode.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.33,0:29:18.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在\N{\rEng}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.06,0:30:25.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达里尔  南边安全\N{\rEng}Daryl, you're clear to the south.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.05,0:30:27.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和塔拉应该回家了\N{\rEng}You and Tara should head home.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.15,0:30:54.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧  快走  走吧\N{\rEng}Let's go! Move it! Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.57,0:30:58.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撤退  快走\N{\rEng}Fall back! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.03,0:31:00.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快撤\N{\rEng}Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.00,0:31:06.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撤退  快撤  快撤\N{\rEng}Fall back! Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.64,0:31:53.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快撤  快撤\N{\rEng}Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.63,0:32:12.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,答案是不行\N{\rEng}The answer is no!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.99,0:32:15.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我永远不会  绝不能同意你的方案\N{\rEng}I will never, not on your Nelly, be on board with your plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.82,0:32:17.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的邀约已被拒绝\N{\rEng}Your invite is declined.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.80,0:32:19.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会沦落到萨沙或你的下场\N{\rEng}I will not end up like Sasha or you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.08,0:32:21.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都做出了选择\N{\rEng}You both made your choices,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.04,0:32:23.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,选了多数人会觉得正确的选择\N{\rEng}what I imagine most will calculate as the right thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.86,0:32:25.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,掷着二十面骰子把自己玩死\N{\rEng}rolled your D20s and came up dead
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.86,0:32:25.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord1}此骰子源自《龙与地下城》桌游
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.55,0:32:27.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,眼看着死期将至\N{\rEng}and seemingly soon to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.32,0:32:28.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恕我不能盲从\N{\rEng}I cannot do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.32,0:32:31.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以随便批判我  但我看得清清楚楚\N{\rEng}Now, judge me if you choose, but I'm seeing 20 for 20,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.06,0:32:33.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心里安安稳稳  听得明明白白\N{\rEng}I'm feeling 10 for 10, I'm receiving 5 by 5
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.23,0:32:35.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不冒风险就是保全性命\N{\rEng}that staying safe means staying alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.11,0:32:37.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要能确保活着  我做什么都行\N{\rEng}and I'm A-okay ‭with doing whatever it takes to lock that down.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.41,0:32:39.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我会听从尼根\N{\rEng}So I will obey Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.06,0:32:42.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会掩护任何人的叛变\N{\rEng}I will not cover for anyone's U-turn on loyalties,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.06,0:32:43.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还会确保\N{\rEng}and I will damn well make sure
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.23,0:32:45.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡森医生舒舒服服地待在这\N{\rEng}that Dr. Carson stays cozy, comfy right here
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.84,0:32:48.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以备我对他医术的不时之需\N{\rEng}in case I ever require his healing expertise!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.54,0:32:51.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会感到自责\N{\rEng}And I won't feel bad about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.50,0:32:53.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我会活下去\N{\rEng}Because I will survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.53,0:32:56.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我血液里的印记\N{\rEng}It's in ‭my biological imperative.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.80,0:32:59.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我唯一知道的事情\N{\rEng}It's all I know how to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.71,0:33:08.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那得用很多弹药\N{\rEng}It'll take an ass-load of ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.75,0:33:11.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\rEng}It will.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.23,0:33:15.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使枪法精湛小心克制\N{\rEng}Even with shot discipline and P and Q minding.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.73,0:33:20.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的造弹专家能把枪装满吗\N{\rEng}Can my bullet maker fill my guns back up?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.46,0:33:27.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你把机器给我  让我操作机器\N{\rEng}If you give my machines to me or me to my machines...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.96,0:33:30.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,答案是肯定的\N{\rEng}that is an affirmative.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.19,0:33:39.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道等我解决完瑞克给我添的麻烦\N{\rEng}You do realize the storm of shit I'm gonna dump on Rick
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.25,0:33:43.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就会给瑞克添大麻烦吧\N{\rEng}as soon as I am clear of the shit storm he dumped on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.92,0:33:46.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\rEng}I do, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.34,0:33:48.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天  尤金\N{\rEng}Goddamn, Eugene.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.57,0:33:52.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你作为除了我以外最重要的人  有何感想\N{\rEng}How does it feel to be the second-most important person here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.49,0:33:56.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拯救这些好人的感觉如何\N{\rEng}How does it feel ‭to save these good people?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.29,0:33:59.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉很好\N{\rEng}It feels great.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.48,0:34:03.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有个要紧事\N{\rEng}Got something else of urgency for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.08,0:34:05.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也帮你解决了\N{\rEng}another item solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.25,0:34:07.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了能冲出尸群\N{\rEng}More than a way out
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.40,0:34:09.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,装满子弹  还有别的惊喜吗\N{\rEng}and a promise of bullets on the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.87,0:34:12.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  尤金\N{\rEng}Jesus, Eugene,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.96,0:34:16.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太棒了\N{\rEng}you are magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.74,0:34:17.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\rEng}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.44,0:34:22.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么事\N{\rEng}So, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.84,0:34:24.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\rEng}Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.58,0:34:29.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\rEng}What? ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.76,0:34:31.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们守住了楼梯\N{\rEng}We have the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.52,0:34:34.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但行尸占据了楼下\N{\rEng}But the dead ones have the lower level --
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.34,0:34:35.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全被占了\N{\rEng}the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.69,0:34:36.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会太久的\N{\rEng}Not much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.62,0:34:40.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尤金想出了让我们摆脱困境的方法\N{\rEng}See, Eugene has solved us a way out of this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.80,0:34:44.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且  他说他还有更好的消息\N{\rEng}And...he actually says he has a topper.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.45,0:34:47.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\rEng}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.51,0:34:57.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能修好内部对讲系统\N{\rEng}I think I could fix the intercom system.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.40,0:34:59.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那能...\N{\rEng}Which, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.82,0:35:03.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全改变这里的通讯现状\N{\rEng}would absolutely change the face of communications here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.60,0:35:06.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这\N{\rEng}That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.74,0:35:09.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  这种事\N{\rEng}Sorry. That kind of thing, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.61,0:35:13.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,令我兴奋\N{\rEng}well, cranks my shaft.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.08,0:35:18.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不打扰你们办事了\N{\rEng}I'll leave you to the last action item.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.50,0:37:48.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该之后了\N{\rEng}Time for after.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.63,0:38:07.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别抗拒\N{\rEng}Subdue!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.44,0:38:49.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在要走出去\N{\rEng}I'm walking out now,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.27,0:38:51.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我走出去意味着你们都得死\N{\rEng}and me walking out means all of you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.71,0:38:55.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的人  他们数量很多\N{\rEng}My people -- there's a lot of them --
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.18,0:38:59.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天不会进攻  但我们会进攻的\N{\rEng}won't attack today, but we will attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.38,0:39:08.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们可以玩游戏  画画\N{\rEng}You can play your games, draw your pictures,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.61,0:39:12.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做他妈的雕塑  但我要走了\N{\rEng}sculpt whatever shit you want, but I am leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.41,0:39:16.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那之后\N{\rEng}After that...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.96,0:39:19.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许你们应该逃走\N{\rEng}maybe you should just run.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.80,0:39:40.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玩够了吗\N{\rEng}We done?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.18,0:39:44.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\rEng}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.80,0:40:00.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加入你\N{\rEng}Join you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.40,0:40:02.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\rEng}What then?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.77,0:40:06.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救世堂被包围了\N{\rEng}The Sanctuary is surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.03,0:40:08.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行尸\N{\rEng}Walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.72,0:40:10.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,基地被围得水泄不通\N{\rEng}20 deep around the compound.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.90,0:40:12.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和我去那里\N{\rEng}You'll come with me there...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.00,0:40:15.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等其他人和我们碰头\N{\rEng}we'll wait till the others meet us.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.36,0:40:18.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见面后  我们要求副手们投降\N{\rEng}When they do, we'll ask the lieutenants to surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.75,0:40:20.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一起要求\N{\rEng}All of us, together.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.80,0:40:25.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后我杀了尼根  独自杀\N{\rEng}Then I kill Negan, me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.68,0:40:31.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成交吗\N{\rEng}We have a deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.39,0:40:37.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事成后  救世军的东西归我们\N{\rEng}After, ‭Saviors' things our things.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.12,0:40:40.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你同意我就同意\N{\rEng}Yes and yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.76,0:40:42.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,东西属于我们所有人\N{\rEng}It'll be all of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.05,0:40:43.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能拿到四分之一\N{\rEng}You'll get a fourth.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.28,0:40:44.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-一半  -四分之一\N{\rEng}- Half. ‭- A fourth.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.74,0:40:49.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四分之一  让我给你做个雕塑\N{\rEng}Fourth, and I sculpt you after.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.83,0:40:53.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为我站着  脱掉裤子\N{\rEng}Stand for me, those off.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.93,0:40:57.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,解开绳子  不准做雕塑\N{\rEng}These off, no sculpting.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.71,0:41:01.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,立刻把鞋和衣服还我\N{\rEng}My boots and my clothes now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.48,0:41:05.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四分之一\N{\rEng}Fourth.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.69,0:41:08.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四分之一\N{\rEng}Fourth.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.75,0:42:15.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狙击手  上报\N{\rEng}Snipers, report in.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.38,0:42:23.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是瑞克·格兰姆斯\N{\rEng}This is Rick Grimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.14,0:42:25.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人收到吗\N{\rEng}Does anybody copy?
